    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Verb government and the case of the relative",
     "texto": [
      "The gender and number of the relative pronoun are given by the antecedent in the main clause, but its grammatical case is determined exclusively by the syntactic function it performs within the subordinate clause.",
      "When the verb of the subordinate clause requires a dative complement, the obligatory forms are:"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
