       "explicacion": "«vertrauen» governs the dative, and the corresponding masculine singular relative is «dem».",
       "correcta": true
      },
      {
       "texto": "Because «Herr Weber» functions as the subject of the subordinate clause.",
       "lengua": "alumno",
       "explicacion": "The subject of the subordinate clause is «wir»; «dem» is the object in the dative.",
       "correcta": false
